  "title": "Pesto Pepper Tortellini",
  "description": "Try this creamy, basil-infused dish for two. Strips of sweet red pepper are sauteed with garlic, cooked with cream and enriched with walnuts, basil and onion. Serve warm over cheese tortellini.",
  "authors": [
